<header>🐱 CatBot Privacy Policy</header>

<div class="container">

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>CatBot respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information is collected and how it is used when you interact with the bot.</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li>User IDs</li>
    <li>Server (Guild) IDs</li>
    <li>Channel IDs</li>
    <li>Messages (only when required for commands)</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
<p>The collected data is used to:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Provide bot functionality</li>
    <li>Respond to commands</li>
    <li>Improve features and performance</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Data Storage</h2>
<p>Data may be temporarily stored to ensure proper bot functionality. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

<h2>5. Data Security</h2>
<p>We take reasonable steps to protect your data, but no system is 100% secure.</p>

<h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>CatBot operates on Discord and may rely on external services for hosting.</p>

<h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
<p>You may request data removal by contacting the developer.</p>

<h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>This policy may be updated at any time. Continued use of the bot means you accept any changes.</p>

<h2>9. Contact</h2>
<p>If you have questions, contact the developer (CrakkoCat).</p>

